#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:1 6ec76a49d59e45fbbf702f5561466868
msgid "Gym Trading Environment"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:3 21b03473eaed4aa38ee6156f6a932b81
msgid ""
"QTrade ships a [Gymnasium](https://gymnasium.farama.org/) environment "
"(`qtrade.env.TradingEnv`) that wraps the same `Broker` as `Backtest`. The"
" agent steps through bars one at a time; same accounting, fill semantics,"
" SL/TP behavior — just driven by `step()` instead of a Python loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:9 98561b040366444c8894812943e70036
msgid ""
"For customizing the action / observation / reward, see [Customizing "
"Trading Environment](customize_environment.md)."
msgstr ""

