#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:158 787896a9154343879b075f5dc88b20c3
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:160 6cb3baa834c042d09754e2baab61247f
msgid ""
"**Sparse reward**: the default reward only fires on bars where a trade "
"closes. Long episodes with no closures train poorly. Either use an "
"equity-based reward (see [Customizing Trading "
"Environment](customize_environment.md)) or shorten episodes so end-of-"
"episode auto-closure provides regular signal."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:165 f51b3e9653274c139bd6b27eefb4ee26
msgid ""
"**Indicators with NaN at start**: any column you add to `data` is "
"observed as-is. NaN in the observation crashes most policies. Drop the "
"warmup rows with `data.dropna(inplace=True)` after computing indicators."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:169 b1b99fdc095a491387800c1009571bcf
msgid ""
"**Action / observation drift**: if you change schemes mid-experiment and "
"load an old model, you'll get shape mismatches. Save model and scheme "
"together when you're going to load."
msgstr ""

